# HCE 索引忽略清单
# 仅排除二进制产物、VCS 目录、含敏感信息的运行时数据;
# 源码、配置模板(.env.example)、文档一律保留索引。

# ===== 编译产物 / 二进制 =====
/proxyflow
/proxyflow.exe
cmd/proxyflow/proxyflow
cmd/proxyflow/proxyflow.exe
*.exe
*.exe~
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib
*.test

# ===== VCS =====
.git/

# ===== 运行时数据(含真实凭据,不入索引) =====
.env
.env.local
proxy.txt
failure-proxy.txt
test-proxy.txt

# ===== 测试 / 覆盖率产物 =====
*.out
coverage.*
*.coverprofile
profile.cov

# ===== Go workspace =====
go.work
go.work.sum
